//   Phase 3: CloseSpanWithinBudget with all remaining budget
//   Phase 4: Fallback UnconstrainedStep up to 80 more steps
//   Phase 5a/5b/5c: Second constrained span handling
//   Phase 6: Force open a span if nothing completed
//   Phase 7: Final safety close
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
