//
//   Phase 2a/2b (ConstrainedStep loops): ConstrainedStep hard-masks to
//     parser-valid tokens plus EOS. AppendConstrainedToken's postcondition
//     gives IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut + [next]). EOS path breaks
//     without appending, leaving state unchanged. CloseSpanIfComplete either
//     closes the span (insideConstrainedOut := false, implication vacuously
//     true, currentConstrainedOut := []) or is a no-op. ✓
//
//   Phase 3/5c/7 (CloseSpanWithinBudget): library postcondition guarantees
//     insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut). ✓
//
//   Phase 4 (UnconstrainedStep + RenderedEndsWith): insideConstrainedOut stays
